WEBVTT

00:18:29.496 --> 00:18:30.946
of extended research team

00:18:30.946 --> 00:18:34.946
and extended educational relationship 
with the institution

00:18:34.946 --> 00:18:37.936
to provide our students 
with the best possible opportunities.

00:18:39.552 --> 00:18:42.392
Let's talk a moment about language,

00:18:42.392 --> 00:18:44.062
in particular, the Arabic language.

00:18:44.062 --> 00:18:47.103
We mentioned in the beginning 
that the context of our discussion

00:18:47.103 --> 00:18:50.073
is that Qatar Foundation and TED
are starting a partnership

00:18:50.073 --> 00:18:54.283
to launch a new platform
for sharing ideas in Arabic.

00:18:54.883 --> 00:18:58.753
Now, Arabic is, I think, the sixth 
most spoken language in the world.

00:18:58.753 --> 00:19:01.853
How do you see its importance 
in the world today?